                            <comment id="16757193" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 31 Jan 2019 12:40:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We mix txHints and flags with operation counter to store compactly.&lt;br/&gt;
This force us to use bit masks in many places that is error prone way.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;mvccOperationCounter method name looks misleading as it is not clear if returned value contains hints\flags or not.&lt;br/&gt;
We have to refactor this.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
